      "text": "Preschool & Kinderfun × Home Programs Recreational Preschool & Kinderfun Gymnastics Trampoline Tumbling Ninjas Drop-Ins Competitive Competitive Trampoline Parties/Camps Birthday Parties March Break Camp Summer Camps Kids' Nights at HHGC About Us About HHGC Our Difference Facilities Management & Staff Board of Directors Coaches Testimonials News HHGC News HHGC Apparel Shop HHGC Newsletter Parent Portal Contact Home Programs Recreational Preschool & Kinderfun Gymnastics Trampoline Tumbling Ninjas Drop-Ins Competitive Competitive Trampoline Parties/Camps Birthday Parties March Break Camp Summer Camps Kids' Nights at HHGC About Us About HHGC Our Difference Facilities Management & Staff Board of Directors Coaches Testimonials News HHGC News HHGC Apparel Shop HHGC Newsletter Parent Portal Contact Pre-school & Kinderfun Breadcrumbs Home Programs Recreational Preschool & Kinderfun Pre-School Drop-in under 4 yrs Cost: $15, one parent/up to 4 children. No pre-registration neccessary and payment can be made in person. Please note that we will numbers in the facility and this program is first come. Days and Times: Tuesday and Thursday 9:30 am - 12:00pm Drop In Begins September 15th and runs till June 26. (Closed Dec. 18 - Jan 5th, not running over March Break) Looking for a fun and safe place to hang out? Come bring your busy preschoo l aged child ( unde r 4 ) to one of our fun-filled drop ins! Parents will stay with their child while their child explores our gymnastics equipment. Bounce on the trampoline, swing on the bars, tumble down the cheese or jump in the pit. No experience necessary. Get involved and play with your kids in the best gymnasium in town. Please note that this program only runs during the school year (Sept- Jun) and follows the same schedule as our recreational programs. There is no drop-in outside of these dates. There is no Drop In on Statutory Holidays or March Break. Drop in is for Pre-school age children only. Kindergym: 3-5 Years Boys & Girls age 3 – 5 years. Kindergym is a fun-filled, structured program that improves balance, flexibility, strength and coordination through our progressive five level skill system that is both rewarding and challenging. This is a 55 min class. Fall 2026 Session 14 (13) weeks: September 12 - December 18 Winter 2027 Session 12 (11/10) weeks: January 2 - April 1 - Registration begins October 27th 12 weeks - Tues, Wed, Thur and Sat classes, 11 weeks - Mon, 10 weeks - Fri **Fees are pro rated for stat holidays where classes are not running ** No Classes March 13 - 19th March Break You never pay HST at HHGC! Advanced Kindergym Boys and Girls: 4-5 Years Advanced Kindergym Boys and Girls: 4-5 Years This is a program for the advanced kinder-gymnast who shows a keen interest and potential for gymnastics. They will learn more advanced basic gymnastic skills, spend more time on the equipment and focus on developing skills with the polish and presentation needed for further advanced gymnastics training. These gymnasts will be working on higher levels within the Kinder program. This program is for both boy & girl gymnasts! This is a 55 minute class for gymnasts aged 4-5 years. Prerequisites - Baby Cartwheel, Baby Bridges without support, Baby Handstands, Hangs on Bars, Balance on higher beam without help Fall 2026 Session 14 (13) weeks: September 12 - December 18 Winter 2027 Session 12 (11/10) weeks: January 2 - April 1 - Registration begins October 27th 12 weeks - Tues, Wed, Thur and Sat classes, 11 weeks - Mon, 10 weeks - Fri **Fees are pro rated for stat holidays where classes are not running ** No Classes March 13 - 19th March Break You never pay HST at HHGC! Parent and Tot 18 months - 3.11 yrs 18 months - 3.11 yrs. This program is for the toddler who loves to be on the move! This class involves parent participation and is led by a coach through a structured warm-up, games, music, and circuits on all gymnastic events. This is a 30 min. class. Fall 2026 Session 14 (13) weeks: September 12 - December 18 Winter 2027 Session 12 (11/10) weeks: January 2 - April 1 - Registration begins October 27th 12 weeks - Tues, Wed, Thur and Sat classes, 11 weeks - Mon, 10 weeks - Fri **Fees are pro rated for stat holidays where classes are not running ** No Classes March 13 - 19th March Break You never pay HST at HHGC! Aspire Group: Girls Aged 4-5 Years The Aspire Group will learn pre-developmental skills for the goal of moving toward the competitive program for female gymnasts. These gymnasts will spend more time on the equipment to work on advancing the skills they already have. Emphasis is put on strength, flexibility, and balance development. Gymnasts will start to become familiar with the Ontario Developmental Program (ODP). This is a 1 hour and 25 minute class for gymnasts aged 4-5 years. Prerequisite: This program is for children who have been recommended by a Coach or Manager demonstrated and have the ability to grasp the concepts of the fundamentals at a more accelerated rate, and have been in a gymnastics program for a minimum of 2 sessions and are ready for more challenges. More exercises to develop strength, co-ordination and flexibility in order to progress. At least 2 sessions prior to this class is a pre-requisite. Fall 2026 Session 14 (13) weeks: September 12 - December 18 Winter 2027 Session 12 (11/10) weeks: January 2 - April 1 - Registration begins October 27th 12 weeks - Tues, Wed, Thur and Sat classes, 11 weeks - Mon, 10 weeks - Fri **Fees are pro rated for stat holidays where classes are not running ** No Classes March 13 - 19th March Break You never pay HST at HHGC! Recreational Programs Recreational Program Schedule Preschool and Kinderfun Parent and Tot:18 Months - 3 Years Kindergym: 3-5 years Advanced Kindergym Boys and Girls: 4-5 Years Little Ninjas Boys and Girls: 4-6 Years Aspire Group: Girls 4-5 Years Pre-school Drop In Gymnastics Boys Gym: 6-12 Years Girls Gym: 6 - 9 Yr Level 1-4 Senior Girls Gym: 10-12 Yrs Level 1-4 Intermediate Girls Gym 6-9 Intermediate Sr Girls Gym (10+) Teen Gymnastics Adult Gym (16+) Teen Open Gym: 14+ (Drop In) Developmental Program - Invite Only Trampoline Beginner Trampoline: 7-12 Years Intermediate Trampoline: 7-12 Years Advanced Trampoline: 9-15 Years Summer Tumbling Camp Tumbling Beginner Tumbling: 7-12 Years Intermediate Tumbling: 7-12 Years Advanced Tumbling: 7-12 Years Summer Tumbling Camp Teen Trampoline / Tumbling: 13-18 Years Ninjas Little Ninjas Boys and Girls: 4-6 Years Ninja Kidz 6-9 Years Ninja Pros 10-12 Years Teen Ninjas: 13-19 Years Drop-Ins Preschool Drop-In Competitive Programs Competitive Competitive Trampoline More info Coaches Facilities Registration Information & Policies Uniforms / Testing Important Dates Recreational Programs Schedule Download Our Latest Newsletter Let's keep in touch! Additional Information Registration info and policies Useful Links Gallery Contact Us Halton Hills Gymnastics Centre 36 Armstrong Avenue Georgetown, Ontario L7G 4R9 905 - 877 - 4330 info@haltonhillsgymnastics.com Special Programs School Visits Special Needs Programs"
